a (correct); parse twice identical (sha256 3474f7a0, effects_fix unchanged); parts zm and zn reparsed after the edits: identical. Merged scratch build with every installed part (after README rows + jurisdiction.json): 204 acts, 3298 versions, 2414 commits, check.py 0 mismatches, 0 trailer errors, --compare identical, audit_push clean on main and futuro.
